d did righteous deeds, their Lord will admit them into His mercy. That is what is the clear attainment.","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"45:31","t":"But as for those who disbelieved, [it will be said], \"Were not Our verses recited to you, but you were arrogant and became a criminal people?","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"45:32","t":"And when it was said, 'Indeed, the promise of Allāh is truth and the Hour [is coming] - no doubt about it,' you said, 'We know not what is the Hour. We assume only assumption, and we are not convinced.'\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":32,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":50,"surahs":[45],"sajdah":false}